      "statement": "Section 1 of the register lists five currently Accepted ADRs binding on payments-adjacent teams: ADR-PAY-017 (Kafka integration backbone, 2023-11-07, all payment systems), ADR-PAY-019 (event-driven channel status, 2024-06-11, all channels), ADR-PAY-021 (hold reason confidentiality, 2025-04-08, PPH v2/channels/data), ADR-PAY-023 (UETR as correlation id, 2025-09-09, PPH/gateways/channels/TDIP), and ADR-PAY-026 (analytics via TDIP Insights API, 2026-05-12, channels/TDIP).",
